{% comment %}
  Verified Buyer Reviews & UGC Photo Feedback Module
{% endcomment %}
<div style="padding: 60px 20px; background: #ffffff; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
  <div style="max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 32px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px;">
      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 4px;">💬 Verified Customer Reviews</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b;">Real feedback from verified buyers across the globe.</p>
      </div>
      <button style="padding: 12px 20px; background: #0f172a; color: #ffffff; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer;">
        ✍️ Write a Review
      </button>
    </div>
    
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 20px;">
      <div style="padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
        <div style="color: #f59e0b; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;">★★★★★</div>
        <h4 style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 6px;">"Absolute Game Changer for My Daily Routine!"</h4>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          Noticed visible results within 3 days. My skin feels deeply hydrated all day without greasy feeling. Highly recommend!
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8;">
          <span style="font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a;">— Sophia M. <span style="color: #16a34a;">✓ Verified Buyer</span></span>
          <span>United States</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
        <div style="color: #f59e0b; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;">★★★★★</div>
        <h4 style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 6px;">"Superb Quality and Packaging"</h4>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          The packaging is ultra luxurious and the formula absorbed instantly. Worth every penny!
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8;">
          <span style="font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a;">— Marcus K. <span style="color: #16a34a;">✓ Verified Buyer</span></span>
          <span>Germany</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
